WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.681
Views, likes and engagement explain attention.

00:00:03.731 --> 00:00:10.522
Growth is different: visibility, mental availability, share of voice, perception and behaviour change.

00:00:11.233 --> 00:00:14.839
A recipe campaign gets a million likes, and the team cheers.

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:17.943
But do more people name the brand unprompted?

00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:19.892
Growth looks like this:

00:00:19.942 --> 00:00:21.543
shoppers talking about your brand,

00:00:21.593 --> 00:00:22.545
not a rival's,

00:00:22.595 --> 00:00:24.863
then searching for it and buying it.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:26.732
Use it like this:

00:00:26.782 --> 00:00:27.781
report attention,

00:00:27.831 --> 00:00:29.444
but judge success on growth,

00:00:29.494 --> 00:00:32.077
compared apples with apples.
